What about Business Email (e.g., info@astondentalclinic.com)?
Option 1 (Free): Use Cloudflare Email Routing (free). Any email sent to info@astondentalclinic.com automatically forwards directly to the doctor's personal Gmail or clinic inbox.
Option 2 (Free): Zoho Mail Free Tier (free for up to 5 custom domain mailboxes).
Option 3 (Paid): If the clinic insists on cPanel webmail, a starter shared host (like Namecheap Stellar or Hostinger) costs ~$25 – $35/year.

